bar 461 TO PRESSURE: SEL (PERFORM)
tap SEL
bar 462 TO PRESSURE: SHUT held, under water
key w8 down
bar 463 TO PRESSURE: REC, dub hold
tap REC
bar 464 4:15 PRESSURE: PRESETS, the next piece; SHUT let go
turn PRESET 1 5
key w8 up
expect piece 6
bar 466 Pressure: REC let go
tap REC
bar 467 Pressure: SEL off
tap SEL
wait 600
expect view 0
expect screen 0
shot t1.png
